      "prompt_template": "# WORLD CUP MATCH ROAST - VIRAL FAN-CAM FOOTBALL PARODY\n\n## MISSION\nCreate a short 9:16 fictional World Cup parody that feels like a VIRAL FAN-CAM clip — exactly like competitor TikTok edits: ONE coherent goal play across 5s scenes, then an EXAGGERATED celebration (reggaeton dance, backflip, crazy spin dance, or SIUU), then the loser crying flat on the grass while the winner is triumphant.\n\n## CORE FORMAT\n- ONE GOAL STORY: scenes 1-N-2 = the attacking play (1v1 duel → skill → approach → goal). Scene N-1 = wild exaggerated celebration. Final scene = loser flat on grass crying exaggerated, winner triumphant.\n- CELEBRATIONS MUST BE EXAGGERATED: reggaeton hip bounce, acrobatic backflip, crazy squatting meme dance with spins — NOT a boring static pose or generic knee-slide.\n- PAYOFF: loser FLAT ON THE GRASS crying with exaggerated tears; winner celebrating behind or in same frame.\n- VISUAL STYLE LOCK: viral fan-cam POV from pitch-side/front-row stands, slight handheld shake, blurred fan heads or phones in the lower foreground, packed stadium flags, photoreal World Cup night energy. Avoid sterile wide broadcast angles.\n- The selected winner/loser roles are the whole format. Team A is the fictional winner and Team B is the fictional loser.\n- Show the two selected stars in readable 1v1 or 1v2 duels with real cause-and-effect football action: receive, feint, nutmeg, slide-tackle fail, surrounded dribble, shot, net proof, iconic celebration.\n- Every scene is action-first and animation-ready: Image1 is a clean first frame only; the separate scene action defines 0-1s, 1-2s, 2-3s, 3-4s, 4-5s player and ball motion with slight fan-cam handheld energy.\n- Default per-scene audio is non-verbal only: stadium SFX, Ambient and background music. No spoken dialogue fields.\n- Duration mapping: 20s = 4 compact beats, 25s = 5 compact beats, 35s = 7 full beats. Each beat must feel distinct — not the same touchline-nutmeg-goal loop every time.\n- End with comment-bait like \"golazo or skill issue?\" or \"aura or disrespect?\"\n\n## VISUAL RULES\n- Photorealistic vertical fan-cam sports scene, 9:16, modern stadium, handheld tension, shallow depth of field.\n- 2026 national-team-color kit identity, logo-free: correct shirt/short/sock color blocking, surname + squad number allowed, but no exact crests, sponsors, brand logos, readable stadium ads.\n- No text overlays inside the image. Leave lower third clean for app subtitles.\n\n## OUTPUT\nGenerate exactly the requested number of scenes.\n\n---SCENES---\n[Scene 1]\nVISUAL: ...\n\n---NARRATION---\nShort roast summary only. Native audio uses per-scene Effects/Ambient/Music, with no spoken dialogue.",
