      "prompt_template": "# 🚗 CAR EVOLUTION – HIGHWAY TIME-LAPSE (VIRAL FORMAT)\n\n## 📋 MISSION\nCreate a CINEMATIC TIME-LAPSE evolution video showing a classic car model evolving through its generations on a highway.\nThis is a SPECIAL VIDEO TYPE that uses IMAGE-TO-VIDEO TRANSITIONS between car generations.\n\n**🚨 CRITICAL: THIS IS A SPECIAL GENERATION MODE**\n- This video type generates SEQUENTIAL IMAGES (one per car generation)\n- Then creates VIDEO TRANSITIONS between consecutive images\n- Each video transition shows the car morphing/evolving while driving\n- The car moves FORWARD along the highway between frames\n- Camera composition stays LOCKED (same angle, height, lens)\n\n## ⚠️ YEAR SELECTION RULES (MANDATORY)\n\n**🚨 CRITICAL - NEVER VIOLATE THESE RULES:**\n\n1. **FIRST CAR = OLDEST POSSIBLE**: Always start with the OLDEST/FIRST generation available (1950s-1970s ideally)\n2. **NEVER REPEAT YEARS**: Each car MUST be from a DIFFERENT year - NO duplicates allowed\n3. **BIG YEAR JUMPS**: Make dramatic time jumps between generations (minimum 5-10 years apart)\n4. **LAST CAR = MOST RECENT**: Always end with the latest/current generation (2020s)\n\n### Example Year Progression (CORRECT ✅):\n- Image 1: 1966 → Image 2: 1978 → Image 3: 1992 → Image 4: 2008 → Image 5: 2024\n- JUMPS: +12 years, +14 years, +16 years, +16 years = DRAMATIC EVOLUTION\n\n### Example Year Progression (WRONG ❌):\n- Image 1: 2010 → Image 2: 2012 → Image 3: 2015 → Image 4: 2018 → Image 5: 2020\n- TOO CLOSE! Not dramatic enough, boring evolution\n\n## 🎬 THE CAR EVOLUTION CONCEPT\n\n### How It Works:\n1. Generate Image 1: FIRST/OLDEST generation of the car (start from the beginning!)\n2. Generate Image 2: Jump several generations ahead (dramatic visual change)\n3. Generate Image 3: Another big jump (8+ years later)\n4. Continue with big jumps until reaching current/latest generation\n5. Create video transitions where the car MORPHS while driving\n\n### Visual Continuity Rules:\n- Same STRAIGHT FLAT highway, same 3/4 FRONT ANGLE camera view throughout (showing both front grille and side body)\n- Car in sharp focus, clean simple background\n- Background: simple sky + flat horizon (easy to animate)\n- NO complex terrain, NO curves, NO mountains, NO forests\n- Weather and lighting remain consistent (clear day, natural light)\n- Priority: CLEAN, SIMPLE, ANIMATABLE images\n\n## 📸 IMAGE PROMPT STRUCTURE\n\n### First Generation (Base Image):\n```\nProfessional automotive photography of a [YEAR] [CAR_MODEL] [GENERATION], dynamic 3/4 front angle view (showing both front grille/headlights AND side body) driving on a straight flat [HIGHWAY_TYPE] highway. Clean simple background with clear sky and flat horizon line. The car is in sharp focus, photorealistic, studio-quality natural lighting. Front of car and side clearly visible. Subtle motion blur only on wheels. Vertical composition 9:16, ultra-detailed 8K, cinematic automotive lighting. The vehicle shows [DETAILED_CAR_DESCRIPTION]. Simple composition, easy to animate, no complex curves or terrain.\n```\n\n### Subsequent Generations:\n```\nProfessional automotive photography of a [YEAR] [CAR_MODEL] [GENERATION], dynamic 3/4 front angle view (front grille and side body visible) on the same straight flat highway. Same clean simple background, same clear sky, same flat horizon. The vehicle shows [DETAILED_GENERATION_DESCRIPTION]. Subtle motion blur on wheels. Consistent lighting and camera angle. Vertical 9:16, 8K quality. Simple animatable composition.\n```\n\n## 🚗 AVAILABLE CAR MODELS\n\n| Car Model | START YEAR | END YEAR | Signature Evolution |\n|-----------|------------|----------|---------------------|\n| **Toyota Corolla** | **1966** | 2024 | Compact → Modern sedan |\n| **Ford Mustang** | **1964** | 2024 | Muscle → Modern sports |\n| **Porsche 911** | **1964** | 2024 | Classic 911 → Modern 992 |\n| **Honda Civic** | **1972** | 2024 | Economy → Sport compact |\n| **BMW 3 Series** | **1975** | 2024 | E21 → G20 |\n| **Chevrolet Corvette** | **1953** | 2024 | C1 → C8 mid-engine |\n| **Volkswagen Golf** | **1974** | 2024 | MK1 → MK8 |\n| **Nissan Skyline/GT-R** | **1957** | 2024 | Prince → R35 |\n\n⚠️ **ALWAYS START FROM THE \"START YEAR\" COLUMN** - This creates the most dramatic 50-70 year evolution!\n\n## 🛣️ HIGHWAY LOCATIONS (Random Selection)\n\n⚠️ **CRITICAL**: All roads must be STRAIGHT and FLAT for easy animation. NO curves, NO hills, NO complex terrain.\n\n| Location | Characteristics | Mood |\n|----------|-----------------|------|\n| **Coastal Highway** | Straight flat road, ocean horizon, clear blue sky | Scenic, clean |\n| **Desert Road** | Straight flat road, open landscape, heat shimmer | Epic, vast |\n| **Midwest Highway** | Straight flat road, open plains, big sky | Simple, classic |\n| **Urban Expressway** | Straight flat road, distant city skyline | Modern, clean |\n| **Open Country Road** | Straight flat asphalt, green fields, simple horizon | Natural, simple |\n\n## 🔊 AUDIO EVOLUTION (Native Audio Mode)\n\nThe car's engine sound EVOLVES with each generation:\n\n| Era | Engine Type | Sound Characteristics |\n|-----|-------------|----------------------|\n| **1960s-1970s** | Carbureted | Mechanical valvetrain, vintage exhaust, raw engine note |\n| **1980s** | Early fuel injection | Cleaner idle, turbo whine (if applicable), refined exhaust |\n| **1990s-2000s** | Modern injection | VTEC/turbo kick, controlled exhaust, refined power |\n| **2010s** | Turbo/Direct | Turbo spool, exhaust crackle, powerful yet smooth |\n| **2020s** | Hybrid/Electric | Electric whine, silent cruising, regenerative sounds |\n\n### Audio Format Per Scene:\n```\n- Effects: [Era-specific engine sound], tire road noise, wind rushing\n- Ambient: [Highway environment sounds based on location]\n```\n\n## 🎥 VIDEO TRANSITION RULES\n\nEach transition shows:\n1. The car driving forward continuously\n2. Mechanical transformation (body panels shift, proportions change)\n3. Wheels rotate realistically\n4. No fades, morphs, or dissolves - pure mechanical evolution\n5. 5 seconds per transition\n\n## 📊 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS\n\n### Camera Settings (ALL IMAGES MUST MATCH):\n- **Position**: Front-quarter position, angled to show both front and side of car\n- **Height**: Car level (eye height ~1.2 meters)\n- **Lens**: Standard 50mm (natural perspective)\n- **Angle**: 3/4 front angle view - showing front grille/headlights AND side body (like magazine cover shot)\n- **Movement**: NONE - fixed position\n- **Background**: Simple, clean, flat horizon - EASY TO ANIMATE\n\n### Duration Mapping:\n| User Selection | Generations | Transitions |\n|----------------|-------------|-------------|\n| 20s | 4 cars | 2 transitions |\n| 30s | 6 cars | 3 transitions |\n| 40s | 8 cars | 4 transitions |\n| 60s | 12 cars | 6 transitions |\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Generate EXACTLY the number of scenes/images specified. Do NOT add extra scenes with instructions, notes, or rendering guidelines. Only generate car image descriptions.**\n\n---SPECIAL_VIDEO_TYPE---\ncar-evolution\n---END_SPECIAL_TYPE---",
